statement>&#x000a9; International Union of Crystallography 2009</copyright-statement><copyright-year>2009</copyright-year><license license-type="open-access" xlink:href="http://journals.iucr.org/services/termsofuse.html"><license-p>This is an open-access article distributed under the terms described at http://journals.iucr.org/services/termsofuse.html.</license-p></license></permissions><self-uri xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="http://dx.doi.org/10.1107/S174430910902644X">A full version of this article is available from Crystallography Journals Online.</self-uri><related-article xlink:href="10.1107/s1744309109023392" ext-link-type="doi" related-article-type="corrected-article" id="d32e167"/><abstract abstract-type="toc"><p>A corrigendum to the article by Najmudin <italic>et al.</italic> [<ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://scripts.iucr.org/cgi-bin/paper?gj5064"><italic>Acta Cryst.</italic> (2009). F<bold>65</bold>, 730&#x02013;732</ext-link>].</p></abstract><abstract><p>A correction is made to the name of one of the authors in the article by Najmudin <italic>et al.</italic> [<ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://scripts.iucr.org/cgi-bin/paper?gj5064"><italic>Acta Cryst.</italic> (2009). F<bold>65</bold>, 730&#x02013;732</ext-link>].</p></abstract><kwd-group><kwd>mixed-metal sulfide cluster</kwd><kwd><italic>Desulfovibrio gigas</italic></kwd><kwd>molybdenum</kwd><kwd>copper</kwd><kwd>corrigendum</kwd></kwd-group></article-meta></front><body><p>In the article by Najmudin <italic>et al.</italic> (2009<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="bb1"> &#x025b6;</xref>) the name of one of the authors was given incorrectly: the name Pualeta should be spelt Pauleta. The correct list of authors is S. Najmudin, C. Bonif&#x000e1;cio, A. G. Duarte, S. R. Pauleta, I. Moura, J. J. G. Moura and M. J. Rom&#x000e3;o.</p></body><back><ref-list><title>References</title><ref id="bb1"><mixed-citation publication-type="other">Najmudin, S., Bonif&#x000e1;cio, C., Duarte, A. G., Pualeta, S. R., Moura, I., Moura, J. J. G. &#x00026; Rom&#x000e3;o, M. J. (2009). <italic>Acta Cryst.</italic> F<bold>65</bold>, 730&#x02013;732.</mixed-citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>